OL,3,GNEWSACampaigner seeks tougher dog
OL,4,Aattack laws for pets
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman is campaigning for a change in
OL,7,Fthe law after her cat was attacked by a
OL,8,Fdog and left for dead.
OL,10,FUnder section three of the Dangerous
OL,11,FDogs Act 1991, it is an offence to
OL,12,Fallow any dog, regardless of breed, to
OL,13,Fbe dangerously out of control.
OL,15,FThe Department for Environment Food and
OL,16,FRural Affairs (DEFRA) said dog attacks
OL,17,Fon other animals may amount to an
OL,18,Foffence under the Act, but it is down
OL,19,Fto the police and Crown Prosecution
OL,20,FService to decide on individual cases.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
