OL,3,GNEWSACampaigner seeks tougher dog
OL,4,Aattack laws for pets
OL,5,
OL,6,FVictoria Ireland, a cat owner from
OL,7,FShrewsbury, said it was not enough and
OL,8,Fcalled for all serious dog attacks on
OL,9,Fcompanion animals to be recorded and
OL,10,Fproperly investigated.
